# Evaluation corpora (see crates/eval). The synthetic corpus is generated on
# demand and never committed:
#   cargo run -p eval -- gen corpus/synthetic
#   cargo run -p eval -- corpus/synthetic      # writes corpus/synthetic/REPORT.md
# Sanitised real agent files supplied by maintainers go in their own
# directories here (`<case>/files…` + `<case>/labels.json`).
/synthetic/
REPORT.md
